---

*This file describes the position an archive of public talks takes towards the
people whose talks it holds. It is not legal advice, and it is not a contract.
If you are a speaker and something here does not sit right with you,
[SPEAKERS.md](SPEAKERS.md) is the short version, and the answer is yes.*
